      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "$1^{\\infty}$ 型，$e^{\\lim v(u-1)}=e^{(1/x)\\cdot 2x}=e^{2}$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "q023",
      "type": "formpower",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "stem": "$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(1+\\dfrac{1}{n}\\right)^{n}=$",
